"height":38},{"text":"핸들러","x":1207,"y":642,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"리스트의","x":1329,"y":642,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"헤드를","x":1485,"y":642,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"가리킨","x":1605,"y":642,"width":104,"height":38}]},{"text":"다. 인터럽트가 발생하면 요청을 처리할 수 있는 핸들러가 발견될 때까지 상응하는 리스","words":[{"text":"다.","x":331,"y":707,"width":40,"height":37},{"text":"인터럽트가","x":391,"y":707,"width":171,"height":39},{"text":"발생하면","x":576,"y":707,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"요청을","x":726,"y":707,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"처리할","x":845,"y":707,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":960,"y":707,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"있는","x":1011,"y":706,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"핸들러가","x":1092,"y":706,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"발견될","x":1246,"y":706,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"때까지","x":1366,"y":706,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"상응하는","x":1484,"y":707,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"리스","x":1642,"y":707,"width":68,"height":38}]},{"text":"트의 핸들러가 하나씩 호출된다. 이러한 구조는 큰 그기의 인터럽트 테이블의 오버헤드","words":[{"text":"트의","x":330,"y":772,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"핸들러가","x":416,"y":772,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"하나씩","x":568,"y":771,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"호출된다.","x":685,"y":771,"width":145,"height":39},{"text":"이러한","x":850,"y":771,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"구조는","x":968,"y":772,"width":104,"height":36},{"text":"큰","x":1086,"y":773,"width":36,"height":35},{"text":"그기의","x":1136,"y":771,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"인터럽트","x":1259,"y":770,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"테이블의","x":1414,"y":771,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"오버헤드","x":1568,"y":771,"width":142,"height":39}]},{"text":"와 하나의 인터럽트 핸들러로 디스패치 하는 비효율성의 절충안이다.","words":[{"text":"와","x":328,"y":836,"width":37,"height":39},{"text":"하나의","x":377,"y":837,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"인터럽트","x":496,"y":837,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"핸들러로","x":645,"y":836,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"디스패치","x":797,"y":835,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"하는","x":947